     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Wednesday, May 17, 2017 at 8:54:28 AM UTC-5, Joshua Spiewak wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I reached out to my co-worker who developed the pool package, and she suggested updating your version of DBI. Her full response was:<div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\">Hi Josh,</span></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><br></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\">I actually know exactly what&#39;s causing this and it can be solved by upgrading to the latest DBI version on CRAN (or latest development version will do too). Basically, DBI &gt; 0.6 breaks back compatibility because they change a method signature (the error above). As soon as that was released on CRAN, I also updated pool to be compatible with the current DBI.</div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><br></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\">So, it seems that that user has an old version of DBI and the current version of pool.</div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><br></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\">That error can reproed with these commands:</div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><br></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"># With DBI &lt; 0.6, trying to install pool results in an error</font></blockquote></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">devtools::install_github(&quot;cran/DBI@882c3921ee58d1fa97298697bf2a50161a8e401a&quot;)</font></blockquote></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">devtools::install_github(&quot;rstudio/pool&quot;)</font></blockquote></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><div><br></div></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\">By upgrading DBI, the problem goes away:</div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><br></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><font face=\"monospace, monospace\"># With current DBI, all is good</font></blockquote></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">install.packages(&quot;DBI&quot;)</font></blockquote></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">devtools::install_github(&quot;rstudio/pool&quot;)</font></blockquote></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\"><br></div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\">Let me know if anything else comes up... Thanks!</div></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:sans-serif\">Barbara</div></div></blockquote><